# Agent Worker — /api/agent/tick
# Vercel Cron: Authorization Bearer <CRON_SECRET> (GET every 15m via vercel.json)
# Manual: Authorization Bearer <AGENT_TICK_SECRET> or x-agent-tick-secret (POST)
